# What must never enter the build context.
#
# The first three lines are the ones that matter. `docker build` sends this
# directory to the daemon and every COPY draws from it, so a secret listed here
# is a secret that cannot end up in a layer by accident — and a layer is
# forever, even if a later step deletes the file.
.env
.env.*
.rivo/

# Runtime state. A portfolio belongs to one deployment; baking one operator's
# positions into an image everyone runs would have the container start up
# believing it owns somebody else's trades.
data/
data*/
*.log

# Rebuilt inside the image by `npm run build:public`, and platform-specific.
node_modules/
public/app.js
public/rivo-public.html
public/calibration.json

# Not part of what runs.
.git/
.github/
.gitignore
Dockerfile
compose.yaml
*.md
!DISCLAIMER.md
rivo-dashboard.html
